        html: '<p>Offices sit where the gravity is gentle and the air is quiet. Weight here is also class. Up here the ground is a terrace or a garden.</p>', facts: [['Weight', '0.9 gee'], ['Ground', 'terrace · garden']], wiki: ['minerva-station', 'Minerva Station'] },
      { id: 'senior', g: 1.0, label: 'Senior offices · 1.0 gee', kicker: '1.0 gee', title: 'Senior offices',
